2:T860,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What does the free landing page audit check?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Seven conversion signals against your actual page: message match (ad promise vs. page headline), trust signals (proof near the CTA), mobile CTA visibility on a 375px viewport, load speed, CTA clarity, SEO foundations (title, meta, H1), and AI readiness. Each returns a pass or fail with the raw evidence from your page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does the audit take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Under 2 minutes. Paste your URL and the results appear automatically. No email or account required to see your findings."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to create an account?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. You see your score and initial findings without sharing an email. You only provide an email if you want the full written report saved to a workspace."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does the $97 One-Leak Repair Sprint include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"One scoped repair package for the highest-priority failing signal on your page, exact copy, code, or configuration change written for your specific page and sent by email within 48 hours. Includes one same-scope re-audit within 30 days. No site access required. Does not promise a conversion-rate outcome."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which platforms does the audit work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Any publicly accessible landing page: Webflow, Framer, Shopify, WordPress, Next.js, Squarespace, ClickFunnels, or a hand-coded page. The audit fetches the public HTML and evaluates what a visitor actually sees."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does the audit not cover?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The audit cannot observe visitor intent, ad audience quality, offer economics, or post-form conversion flows. It checks observable page conditions, the things a visitor experiences before they decide to act or leave. Business outcomes also depend on traffic quality and offer strength."}}]}9:X
