1c:["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"faq-heading","className":"border-t border-border bg-bg-muted/10 px-6 py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"faq-heading","className":"mb-8 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-3xl","children":"Common questions"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-8","children":[["$","div","What does the free landing page audit check?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"What does the free landing page audit check?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-fg-muted","children":"Nine conversion signals against your actual page: message match (ad promise vs. page headline), trust signals (proof near the CTA), mobile CTA visibility on a 375px viewport, load speed, CTA clarity, SEO foundations (title, meta, H1), above-fold clarity, ad tracking, and AI readiness. Each returns a pass or fail with the raw evidence from your page."}]]}],["$","div","How long does the audit take?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"How long does the audit take?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-fg-muted","children":"Under 2 minutes. Paste your URL and the results appear automatically. No email or account required to see your findings."}]]}],["$","div","Do I need to create an account?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Do I need to create an account?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-fg-muted","children":"No. You see your score and initial findings without sharing an email. You only provide an email if you want the full written report saved to a workspace."}]]}],["$","div","What does the $97 One-Leak Repair Sprint include?",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"What does the $97 One-Leak Repair Sprint include?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading